steps.prompt:
So far the tables were given to us. CREATE TABLE builds a new one.
You name the table, then list columns: name TYPE.
CREATE TABLE favorites (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, product_name ___);

Now fill it with one row:
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS wishlist (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT, price REAL);
INSERT INTO wishlist (name, price) VALUES ('Beni Ourain Rug', 3356.82);
